        "text": "The Senator's presence at the event is valuable and noteworthy.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "A conversation about this book is meaningful and worth engaging in.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The timing of discussing the book is significant and warrants explanation.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
