      },
      {
        "text": "Disagreement was seen as essential to generating better, more durable solutions than authoritarian rule.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Greater diversity of voices in political decision-making leads to a stronger nation.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
