  {
    "episode_id": 92914,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92914.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 19,
    "turn_text": "Well, and not just change, but sustaining the republic, right? So your discussion, which you also included in this book about all of us as founders, that this is a process of creation that is happening every day, really resonated with me. I have been on this campaign to get sports arenas when they play the national anthem and they put the words up to make sure to include the question mark at the end. People don't focus on the fact that the National Anthem starts with a question and never answers that question and ends with the same question. Does that flag still fly over the land of the free and the home of the brave? And it is our obligation every day to make sure that the answer to that question is yes.",
